OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe rain and low cloud
OL,6,Flingering, only clearing to the
OL,7,Fsoutheast early afternoon. Then
OL,8,Fbecoming fine and dry with sunny
OL,9,Fspells, and coastal showers developing
OL,10,Fin the evening.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloudy with showers, though
OL,13,Fcloud will clear overnight inland and
OL,14,Ftemperatures will fall and could see a
OL,15,Ffrost in rural places. Staying cloudy
OL,16,Falong the coast with isolated showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
